# setuptools' legacy default sdist rules glob tests/test*.py but not conftest.py, so
# the sdist shipped the suite without its autouse `isolated_cache` fixture. Anyone
# running the tests from the sdist — every distro packager's %check — got 3 failures
# and 5 errors that don't reproduce from a git checkout. Ship the whole tests/ tree.
recursive-include tests *.py
